Package: modelcompR
Title: Symbolic Numeric Modeling in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Adam R", "Sophie", email = "adamrsophie@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A native R port of the Julia library 'ModelingToolkit.jl'.
    Models are written as symbolic equations with variables, parameters and
    hierarchical components; 'mtkcompile' simplifies them structurally
    (alias elimination, index reduction, tearing) and generates R functions
    for ordinary and differential algebraic equations, nonlinear systems,
    optimization, stochastic, jump, delay, discrete and boundary value
    problems, which are solved by pure R integrators. Symbolic computation is
    provided by 'symcompR'. The design and algorithms follow
    'ModelingToolkit.jl' <https://github.com/SciML/ModelingToolkit.jl>,
    whose MIT license notice is retained in the package.
